<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the singles matches in</p>
<p>Davis Cup Euro/African zone group three on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Baris Ergum (Turkey) beat Christian Rosti (San Marino) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Erhan Oral (Turkey) beat Domenico Rosti (San Marino) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Samuel Gebriel (Ethiopia) beat Dragan Jovanovski (Macedonia)</p>
<p>2-6 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Zoran Sevcenko (Macedonia) beat Yohanes Setegne (Ethiopia) 6-0</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Jean-Noel Said (Senegal) beat Haris Basalic (Bosnia)</p>
<p>7-6 6-3</p>
<p>Adria Graimprey (Luxemburg) beat Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia)</p>
<p>6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Sacha Toma (Luxemburg) beat David Babayan (Armenia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
